{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12115","headline":"李士曹厅对雨 · 钱起","name":"李士曹厅对雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春雨暗重城，讼庭深更寂。\n终朝人吏少，满院烟云集。\n湿鸟压花枝，新苔宜砌石。\n掾曹富文史，清兴对词客。\n爱尔蕙兰丛，芳香饱时泽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12115.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12115","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}